WEBVTT

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.740
<b>Tradition! Binan High School 
Pretty Boy Contest</b>

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.740
<b>Beautiful, Proper, Pure</b>

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:07.740
<b>The 27th of Every Month is Pretty Boy Day</b>

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.190
<i>My name is Kurotori Moteo.</i>

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.930
<i>Advisor to Binan High School's Ballet Club.</i>

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.040
<i>Likes: Being popular.</i>

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.290
<i>Dislikes: Heaviness.</i>

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.910
<b>Kurotori Moteo</b>

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.910
<i>It carries no weight with the ladies.</i>

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.610
This month, at last...

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:26.880
I will take the crown of Binan 
High School's #1 Pretty Boy!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.050
I saw nothing.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.890
Let's say we saw nothing.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:45.350
That's just what he wants.

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:46.660
How come?

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.240
You could see Mr. Kurotori's entire—

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:52.500
It's fine for you! You're the bath attendant.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.390
Since it's something we didn't want to see,

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.250
we want to say we didn't see it!

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:01.060
Huh? Why didn't you want 
to see Mr. Kurotori's—

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.230
There's no reason!

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:04.270
Most people wouldn't want to see that.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:06.810
What's wrong with hanging out naked?

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.760
I love it. Seeing it <i>and</i> showing it!

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.250
Hello there.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.830
My sweet honeys.

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:17.600
Pardon me for going on ahead.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.730
G-Goodbye.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:20.560
Thanks for coming!

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.970
Spin, spin, spin!

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:24.590
Spin, spin, spin!

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:59.910
Feel Love, Narcissus!

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:04.110
Oh? That had to be on purpose, right?

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:05.200
Yeah.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:06.780
Did you know?

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:11.450
They say that hiring him for 
our school was an accident.

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:12.900
Mr. Kurotori?

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:17.200
Yeah. Apparently the principal 
wanted a volleyball club advisor,

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:21.010
but he accidentally hired a 
ballet dance club advisor.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.500
That seems too stupid to be true.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.700
But this is a principal who 
holds monthly pretty boy contests

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.450
even though it's an all-boys' school.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.810
Now that you mention it, 
I suppose it <i>is</i> possible...

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.810
But why hold a pretty boy 
contest at an all-boys' school?

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:39.780
Maybe it's <i>because</i> there are only boys here?

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.240
Huh? The Ballet Club?

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.740
You are the chosen students.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.710
<b>Ballet Club</b>

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:47.710
Because you both caught my eye.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:51.710
Well? Won't you arabesque with me?

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.680
Is there a financial advantage 
to be gained from this?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.900
One can expect profits from 
recital entrance fees and,

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.640
if one becomes a star, profits 
from sales of merchandise.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.780
Merchandise, eh?

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:05.230
How do girls like it?

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:10.150
It's no exaggeration to say that 
90% of ballet fans are women.

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:14.230
I await a positive response from you both.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.140
That's the Ballet Club advisor, Kurotori.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:20.380
He's been pestering me to join, too.

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:24.660
I heard that his club 
doesn't have a single member.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:28.380
If this keeps up, we will be 
forced to shut his club down.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:32.720
But Kurotori's goal probably isn't 
to gain more club members.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.540
It's to gain more fans.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:40.760
Disciples to give him votes 
in the pretty boy contest, eh?

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.650
In terms of cost-effectiveness, 
the Ballet Club isn't a very good prospect.

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:49.570
You decided to calculate it?

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.920
You never know where you might find gold.

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:55.310
Would you ever join the Ballet Club, Ryuu?

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:56.790
Nah.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:00.030
He said 90% of ballet fans are girls,

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:03.080
but the people around me 
are 100% girls, all the time.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.570
So if I did ballet, my ratio 
would actually go down.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.170
Even if the ratio went down,
the overall parameters would go up...

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.810
But I won't bother talking to you about numbers.

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:13.680
Well, all I know is...

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.480
Money is...

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:15.200
Women are...

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.130
Life!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.080
Zaou-kun, Naruko-kun.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.480
Here are the voting forms 
for the pretty boy contest.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.180
Put them in the voting box as usual.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:27.350
What an annoyance. 
I can't make a single yen off this.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:31.360
And if I don't take #1, 
the girls will throw a fit.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:34.310
You've never taken #1.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:36.770
What are you looking at?

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.620
I could ask you the same.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.280
You can't seem to take your eyes off me.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:43.570
What are you talking about?

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:50.960
Heading that way, my sweet honey?

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:55.920
Why not celebrate youth in the Ballet Club?

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.870
That paper's great!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.840
Read the reverse side closely, too.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.800
<b>Binan High School Pretty Boy Contest

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.800
<b>Cast a pure vote for Prince Kurotori</b>

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.800
Cast a pure vote for Prince Kurotori.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.380
This paper sure is great!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.770
The paper?

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.520
<b>Earth Defense Club                        (lol)</b>

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.480
Basketball Club, go!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.820
Now, the Ballet Club! Go!

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:22.780
Wow!

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:25.940
I knew it! The Ballet Club wins by a long shot!

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:30.520
He seems to have spent a lot of money 
on good paper for his pamphlets.

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.040
Lousy taste, though.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.470
What are you doing, Yumoto?

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:37.140
Looks like he's deciding which club to join,

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:38.750
based on paper airplane distance.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.740
That's horrible!

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:41.500
What is?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.130
You are already in a club-paparazzi!

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:44.720
Huh?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:48.430
Our "Defenders of Love Earth Defense Club"!

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.380
Don't just name it without asking.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.390
And you're saying 
authoritatively that it's a club?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:56.500
I submitted the application with 
Tawarayama-san as the advisor.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:59.410
But monsters don't attack every day.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.560
I'm bored.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.500
That's no reason to two-time me!

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.530
You play with me and cuddle 
me every day, and yet...

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.970
But you only let me cuddle you once a day.

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.810
Yumoto really is formidable.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:14.490
Yeah.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.830
Speaking of which, this pretty boy contest...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.160
<b>Binan High School Pretty Boy Contest

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.160
<b>Cast a pure vote for Prince Kurotori</b>

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:18.160
When is it again?

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:21.760
<b>Pretty Boy Day
27th (bi-nan-shi)</b>

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.500
Every month on the 27th.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.760
"Binanshi" means Pretty Boy Day.

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:24.840
Isn't "27" more like "two-na," 
which makes "Tuna" Day?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.050
Not like I care, but the one thing 
I can't stand is losing to that Gero guy.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:30.970
Why is that?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.990
Did you actually have a rivalry going?

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:34.390
Mildly so.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:38.720
Now that you mention it, last month, 
Ryuu and Gero tied for 3rd place.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:40.980
With Kusatsu at #1 and Arima at #2.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:44.050
I bet the student council members 
got whole groups to vote for them!

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.940
The point is, I'm knocking Gero out.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.660
Sounds fun.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.490
Huh? How so?

00:07:50.880 --> 00:07:54.140
A battle between the Earth 
Defense Club's "#1 Hustler" Zaou

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:57.160
vs. the student council's 
"Chief Narcissist" Gero.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.210
You're bored too, huh, En-chan?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.790
Thus, I call a strategy meeting to 
figure out how to bring Ryuu victory.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:04.500
<b>What is POPULARITY?</b>

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.500
Here's the topic for debate.

00:08:04.740 --> 00:08:07.340
There? We're starting from there?

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:10.260
It's not attractive to achieve 
only superficial popularity.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:14.290
To achieve true popularity, 
one must discover its essence.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.350
Is this really going to make me #1?

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.310
I have a question, as well.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.190
This is an all-boys' school.

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:25.400
Is it acceptable that "popularity" in 
this case refers to popularity with boys?

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:26.750
It is.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:27.780
It is?

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:31.440
Huh? We're thinking of ways 
to get popular with boys?

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.120
Putting all our heads together?

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:34.240
It's for Ryuu's sake.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.790
Even if it won't earn me a single yen,

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.090
I suppose I must, if it's for Ryuu's sake.

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.760
Huh? Seriously?

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:45.300
If you're gonna be popular, wouldn't 
it be better to be popular with girls?

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.490
You're so naïve, Yumoto.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.770
To be frank, there's no point 
in being popular with girls.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:50.760
Why not?

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.220
Girls are to be admired.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:55.920
You mean love them, 
rather than be loved by them?

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:58.930
They do say that men are
more admiring of manly traits.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.880
That's right.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:04.150
They also say that women betray, 
but men do not.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.850
Although money is even more loyal.

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:10.290
The point is, there's value 
in being a man loved by men!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:11.450
He said it outright!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.600
Oh! But now that you mention it, 
when I watch yakuza flicks,

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.120
my heart always flutters at the 
sight of a young gang leader.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.660
Did you just come out?!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.540
Okay. Now that we have the 
definition of popularity,

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:24.320
our next subject is "approach."

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:26.630
How do you get popular 
with men? Think about it!

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:27.910
Yeah!

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:30.340
What are they so fired up for?

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.720
<b>[Requirements to be popular with men]</b>

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:33.720
<b>1. Strength

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.180
We've solidified the popularity requirements.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:39.300
The #1 requirement 
being strength is realistic.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.140
#3 being brotherliness is realistic, too.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.780
Money is important, too.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:47.410
You got tired of it, did you?

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:49.980
Yeah, 'cause I hate thinking.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:55.680
Okay. Let's put our approach
into practice, and see

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:56.570
if it produces results!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:57.930
Yeah!

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:03.050
Oh, if only they'd be so passionately 
macho about being the Battle Lovers!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.890
En-chan. Can you do this?

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:14.570
That guy looks strong.

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:16.190
No problem. First...

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:17.340
You kill with the eyes!

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:19.310
Not with strength?

00:10:23.710 --> 00:10:24.880
Ready...

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:25.780
Go!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.810
Senpai! Go over the top!

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.270
Yeah!

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:36.740
Over... the... top!

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.390
Winner: Yufuin!

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:46.430
All right!

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:58.380
Hey. What do you think of me?

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.220
What?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.900
I'm asking what you think of me.

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.390
Well... Nothing in particular...

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:05.740
What about now?

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.480
<b>Account Balance</b>

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:15.460
I-Incredible!

00:11:15.460 --> 00:11:16.200
It's incredible!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.460
He's fallen.

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:20.860
The power of money is incredible!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.870
<b>Class 1-A</b>

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.250
Working hard?

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:33.420
Can we help you?

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.760
You're triplets, right?

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.490
Yes. As you can see.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.610
You want a big brother?

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.440
Huh?

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:41.810
That came out of nowhere.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:44.180
Well, let's watch to the end.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:52.070
You enjoy this cleaning stuff?

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:54.210
We don't enjoy it...

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:55.440
But we're on duty, so...

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.030
We have to do it...

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:59.990
Then... I'll make it so you can't!

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.840
H-Huh?!

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.480
Now you can't clean, right?

00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.260
It wasn't your fault.

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:25.220
Let's hang. Come on.

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:28.640
Big brother!

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:30.200
Big brother!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.140
Let me call you big brother!

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:33.420
Big brother!

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:37.140
He seized the hearts of the triplets?!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:38.590
Cool!

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.450
Those idiots are up to something again.

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:44.820
It's not at all beautiful, is it?

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:47.960
Things are drifting downwards. Let's go.

00:12:49.060 --> 00:12:53.960
<b>Kinugawa Atsushi
Born October 5th
Blood Type A / Libra
Hobby: Jigsaw Puzzles
Likes: Baths, hot springs, curry</b>

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:57.920
<b>Mr. Kurotori Rally</b>

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:05.140
Why? Why did no one come?!

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:10.350
After I made such a grand showing 
at the arm wrestling tournament...

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:14.530
If this continues, my position of 
#1 pretty boy in Binan High School

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:16.540
will once again be taken 
by the student council...

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:20.160
No, by the dark horse, 
the Earth Defense Club!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.130
Ah...

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:26.530
They should all revere me,
honor me, love me! Why?!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:27.950
Why?!

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.540
He may be a suitable servant.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.460
Yes, Lord Zundar.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:36.130
Go, Caerula Adamas!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.580
Conquest!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:45.880
We are the rulers of this blue world...

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.840
Caerula Adamas!

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:52.180
Now, release the Zundar Needle!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:55.330
Aurum!

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.880
Argentum!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:57.880
Perla!

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:02.820
Donum!

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.700
1579th Pretty Boy Contest

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:17.720
Today's the day to vote 
in the pretty boy contest!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.670
Please cast your pure, 
proper, beautiful votes!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.380
We've done all we can.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:26.560
Now we wait for the 
proclamation from on high.

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:27.520
We have?

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:31.020
I'm voting for you.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:32.110
Right.

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:33.760
I'll put in for you, Naruko-kun.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:34.900
Thanks.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.330
Big brother! We're gonna vote for you!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.680
Let's play again sometime.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.110
Eee!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.270
Big brother.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.520
Shut up.

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:54.320
<b>Pretty Boy Contest</b>

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:49.300
Now, the man who will 
shine as honored king

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:54.320
of the 1579th Binan High School 
Pretty Boy Contest is...

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.340
The name is...

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:01.090
It's me!

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.210
Swan! Swan!

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:07.210
What's that thing?!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:11.040
Hey! A monster appeared!

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:12.640
Why now, of all times?!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:16.120
I have money riding on this,
so I'd rather it not be ruined.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:17.430
What should we do?

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.520
What a pain.

00:15:18.520 --> 00:15:21.000
Everyone! Love me!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.690
Love Feather Storm!

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:27.770
I love the guy with the black wings!

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:29.940
I love you!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.300
Gross!

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:35.700
Don't freak out! Fight!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.020
What was that move, anyway?

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:39.370
It's pretty idiotic.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.630
Part of me wants to applaud 
the opponent's cleverness, but...

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.350
You see?

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.230
With this plan, we will create 
a world where boys love boys,

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:51.100
thus allowing no one to create any progeny!

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:53.100
Now, the Earth will fall to ruin.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:56.180
What will you do, Battle Lovers?!

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:57.820
Hey!

00:15:57.820 --> 00:16:01.060
Would you get to the Love Making already?!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.920
That's right! We can Love Making!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:05.680
Oh, we're doing that again?

00:16:06.470 --> 00:16:08.110
Love Making!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:35.040
The Sparkling Prince!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.270
Battle Lover Scarlet!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.330
Love Making.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.580
The Flashing Prince!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.810
Battle Lover Cerulean!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.050
Love Making.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:03.840
The Piercing Prince!

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:06.380
Battle Lover Epinard!

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:08.630
Love Making.

00:17:16.980 --> 00:17:18.490
The Roaring Prince!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.850
Battle Lover Sulfur!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:22.980
Love Making!

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.080
The Thrilling Prince!

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:35.360
Battle Lover Vesta!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:37.330
What?!

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.110
You, who befoul our beloved Earth!

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:42.870
No justice can come from loveless power!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.130
Love is all!

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:47.620
Live for love! Die for love!

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:50.760
We are the heirs to the throne of love!

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.260
Battle Lovers!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.070
Feel the power...

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.520
Of love!

00:17:57.800 --> 00:17:59.640
Scarlet Lumiere!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.180
I'm glad to see you, Battle Lovers!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:04.930
What?!

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:08.440
Now, love me to your heart's content!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:11.070
Love Feather Splash!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.610
Ow! Ouch!

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.290
Once you've been pierced by 
my love feathers, it's over!

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:21.240
No one can resist loving me!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.390
Come on! Gimme a hug!

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:26.130
Damn! I wanna hug it!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.620
I'll pay money for it!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:29.030
I want to marry it.

00:18:31.010 --> 00:18:32.880
I can't take it! I'll be right back!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:35.070
He ran off without us!

00:18:35.070 --> 00:18:36.840
I never realized he was that kind of guy.

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.980
Wow! You flew, Senpai!

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:50.060
You, with your beautiful wings...

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.640
Let me show you the love 
that burns within me...

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.200
Hold it!

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.100
I've got more money than him!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:57.710
I have marriage on my mind!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:18:59.190
I love you!

00:18:59.190 --> 00:18:59.890
I love you!

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:00.820
I love you!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:01.660
I love you!

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:07.880
That's perfect! More love! 
Offer me all your love!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.590
Darn it, these guys!

00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.920
Senpai! You're humiliating yourself!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.740
Don't interfere!

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.610
They love me!

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:21.030
Why don't you love me, too?

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:23.640
I hit you with my love feather!

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.350
I don't understand that kinda thing.

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.610
In that case...

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:30.170
What about now?!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.980
Why do you want to be loved so badly?

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.570
Why...?

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:40.660
You've never loved anyone, have you?

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.700
I think loving feels way 
better than being loved.

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.970
You can cuddle, and it feels really great!

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:50.140
Cuddle?

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.800
Yeah, cuddle!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:53.860
And if there's no one you love right now,

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:56.080
you should try cuddling yourself!

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.360
It feels great!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.800
What is he talking about?

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.770
I don't know, but it's very passionate.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:06.230
Before you try to get anyone to love you,

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:08.430
try loving yourself first.

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:10.960
Is now... our chance?

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.180
Now!

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:14.670
Sparkle, Lumiere of Love!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.150
Flash, Purifying Aqua!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.660
Pierce, Gallant Hurricane!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.160
Roar, Raging Gaia!

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.660
Thrill, Blazing Ignit!

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:41.070
Love Attack!

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:52.860
How could I not realize 
something so important?!

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:56.970
He's right! How can you live
without loving yourself?

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:59.080
The one you should love... is yourself!

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:00.690
That's right!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:04.540
Love Shower!

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:10.820
I love me!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.210
Love is over!

00:21:18.970 --> 00:21:21.560
The monster was Mr. Kurotori?

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:25.420
He looks happy, though.

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:27.890
Yes, he looks comfortable.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:29.840
I'm tired.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.610
We lost again.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:39.060
The Battle Lovers... Just who are they?

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:44.070
We will surely have them grovel at our feet.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:46.030
<b>Kurotama Bath</b>

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.910
Yumoto. How's the water today?

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:55.620
Perfect again today, Gora.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:59.410
Hey, random question.

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:01.920
Which part do you guys wash first?

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:03.340
My neck, I guess?

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:04.120
My arms!

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:05.280
Armpits.

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:06.610
The nape of the neck.

00:23:40.740 --> 00:23:42.430
That reminds me. When we
were in elementary school,

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:44.260
we went to see a meteor shower.

00:23:44.260 --> 00:23:46.710
I wish we could be kids again.

00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:48.320
Wait, we <i>are</i> kids again!

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:50.770
Could a monster be behind this?

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:53.020
Next time: Cute Little 
Boys of Love and Youth.

00:23:51.720 --> 00:23:54.900
Next Time

00:23:51.720 --> 00:23:54.900
Cute Little Boys of Love and Youth

00:23:53.020 --> 00:23:54.480
Love Making!
